  "description": "In an era when high-performance android rental services, virtually indistinguishable from humans, have become commercially available. Hoping to strike it rich while being pampered by a wealthy, lonely housewife, Kim Su-Hwan gets a job under the guise of an android. However, upon meeting his new employer, a sinister-looking man named Jang-U, his plan takes an unexpected turn. What Jang-U proposes to the human Su-Hwan is that he help him, as an android, overcome his fear of human contact…?! \n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
